# DclawOS 2.0 desktop: minimal X11 session (Openbox) + DclawOS shell.
# Deliberately NOT a full GNOME desktop: no gnome-shell, no gdm3, no
# gnome-control-center, no nautilus, no Firefox, no Office, no image/video
# viewers. The shell, dashboard, settings app and agent service are
# DclawOS-native and land module by module.
